{"id":692,"name":"clauncher","speciesId":692,"dex":692,"form":"normal","generation":6,"types":["water"],"stats":{"hp":50,"attack":53,"defense":62,"special-attack":58,"special-defense":63,"speed":44},"abilities":[{"name":"mega-launcher","hidden":false}],"height":5,"weight":83,"baseExp":66,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/692.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/692.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/692.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/692.ogg","genus":"Water Gun Pokémon","genusPt":"Pokémon Pistola de Água","flavor":[{"version":"x","text":"They knock down flying prey by firing compressed water from their massive claws like shooting a pistol."},{"version":"y","text":"Through controlled explosions of internal gas, it can expel water like a pistol shot. At close distances, it can shatter rock."},{"version":"ultra-sun","text":"Its claws occasionally fall off, and it keeps a low profile until they grow back. The meat of its claws is so delicious!"},{"version":"ultra-moon","text":"It moves around by jetting water from its right pincer. It has a poor sense of balance, so it’s terrible at swimming straight."},{"version":"sword","text":"Clauncher’s claws can fall off during battle, but they’ll regenerate. The meat inside the claws is popular as a delicacy in Galar."},{"version":"shield","text":"By detonating gas that accumulates in its right claw, this Pokémon launches water like a bullet. This is how Clauncher defeats its enemies."}],"flavorPt":"Ao detonar o gás que se acumula na sua garra direita, este Pokémon lança água como uma bala. É assim que Clauncher derrota seus inimigos.","genderRate":4,"captureRate":225,"eggGroups":["water1","water3"],"isLegendary":false,"isMythical":false,"evolution":{"species":"clau